# Healthcare Analysis

This project focuses on analyzing Healthcare dataset using a public dataset.

The purpose of this project is to understand patients behavior and identify basic patterns related to medical.

---

## Scope of Work
- Data cleaning and preprocessing using Pyton
- Checking duplicates and organizing the dataset
- Creating simple visualizations using Power BI

---

## Files
- Healthcare-analyst.pbix
- Healthcare-analyst.pdf
- clean_healthcare_dashboard.csv
- healthcare-analyst.ipynb

---

## Tools Used
- Python
- Power BI

---

This project is part of my data analysis learning and portfolio development.
